---
import VideoPanel from './VideoPanel.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="heading" data-reveal>
      <p class="kicker">01 / About Cheshire Visual</p>
      <h2>Drone &amp; 360&deg; video,<br />done to a standard.</h2>
      <div class="panel">
        <VideoPanel src="/videos/hero.mp4" ratio="4 / 5" anim="kb2" label="On location" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="copy" data-reveal>
      <p>
        Cheshire Visual is a CAA-licensed drone, aerial and 360&deg; photography and video production
        studio based in Cheshire, filming across the North West of England &mdash; Chester, Manchester,
        Liverpool, Warrington and beyond.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work with property developers, construction firms, schools, colleges, sports clubs and event
        venues who need footage that actually does a job: prospectus films that fill open days, progress
        surveys that keep stakeholders informed, and 360&deg; virtual tours that let people walk a space
        before they ever visit.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every flight is planned, insured and CAA compliant. Every edit is graded, sound-designed and
        delivered ready to publish &mdash; on your site, in your prospectus, or across social. No drama,
        just footage that works as hard as you do.
      </p>
      <ul class="stats">
        <li><span>CAA</span>Licensed remote pilot</li>
        <li><span>4K&nbsp;/&nbsp;8K</span>Aerial &amp; 360&deg; capture</li>
        <li><span>North West</span>Cheshire-based, flying region-wide</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    position: relative;
    padding: 130px var(--section-x);
  }

  .inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .inner > [data-reveal]:nth-child(1) {
    transition-delay: 0s;
  }

  .inner > [data-reveal]:nth-child(2) {
    transition-delay: 0.12s;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-55);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.2vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .panel {
    margin-top: 40px;
    max-width: 320px;
  }

  .copy p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-72);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .stats {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 32px 0 0;
    padding: 24px 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-12);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .stats li {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-55);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .stats span {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 26px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .panel {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
